abstract: >-
  This project's aim is to simulate the formation of the
  Talbot effect in the near field of an infinite periodic
  diffraction grating of Fourier coefficients gn. This
  corresponds to the numeric part of the paper "The Talbot
  Effect as a Causal Initial–Boundary-Value Problem:
  Formation, Stationary Limit and Paraxial Limit", whose
  first version is the arXiv preprint 2507.00820,
  "Deducing the Talbot Effect from Electrodynamics".
